[[Image:Purgation Isle.jpg|thumb|300px|Purgation Isle.]]
'''Purgation Isle''' is an island south of the shores of [[Hillsbrad Foothills]], in a shape of a towering spiral. It contains a cemetery and a ruined scout tower.

The island has a mysterious, unknown history. It is haunted by the ghosts of renegade [[paladin]]s of the [[Knights of the Silver Hand|Silver Hand]], [[priest]]s of the [[Church of Light]], but also [[monk]]s and [[mage]]s, that for some reason were condemned to be banished on the island and since cannot find peace in death. It seems that [[Kormok]] is the cause of the isles ghosts as it is said that he delighted in summoning forth the souls of the banished dead.

