==Notes==
* Before patch 1.10.0, the mobs on the Isle were only level 20-30. After that, the mobs were replaced with 57+ elites, and became part of the [[Tier 0.5]] armor quest.

==Speculation==
Purgation Isle may be part of the [[Channel Islands]].

